<section id="office"><h2>Garage mini office: standing desk at the south window</h2>
<p>Updated Nov 23, 2026. The office sits on the <b>south wall, in front of the rear (southwest) window</b>, not tucked into the corner: about 10 × 9′8″ (≈99 sf) with a <b>new standing desk</b> facing the window, a stool, and a small file cabinet. The stretch / TV corner and the existing gray workbench run share the back-left corner. The glass desk and Aeron move down to the new secondary office in basement storage.</p>
<div class="fig2"><figure><a href="img/g-standing-desk.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" src="img/g-standing-desk.jpg" alt="Mini office with a standing desk at the rear south window"></a><figcaption>New standing desk facing the rear south window (concept)</figcaption></figure><figure><a href="img/full/687-garage-gym-v2.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" src="img/687-garage-gym-v2.jpg" alt="Garage v3 plan"></a><figcaption>Office location on the v3 plan (left wall, at window W2)</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h3>Build-out</h3><ul>
<li><b>Walls:</b> 2×4 with mineral-wool batts and 5/8″ drywall. The gym-facing wall is doubled for sound.</li>
<li><b>Lid:</b> its own insulated drywall ceiling at about 7′3″, which can double as a small storage deck.</li>
<li><b>Light:</b> the south window and the existing garage lighting, plus a glass-lite door; nothing new added.</li>
<li><b>Comfort:</b> the existing garage heater, a small fresh-air fan, and a CO alarm (required in a closed garage room).</li>
<li><b>Access:</b> the door opens toward the gym; about 4 ft to the platform edge.</li>
</ul></div>
