<li>Confirm each HD-9XW (110.25 in overall width, 100.25 in posts) in the 10-ft bays, including a ~2 ft shift toward the ridge. Tape the ceiling along those shifted centerlines. Confirm the right-lift front posts and a car on top against the 8-ft door’s overhead tracks. Measure the XT5 with and without roof rails, and the Model Y with and without a rack, against the planned mid-lock drive-unders (about 74 in left, 72 in right).</li>
